### 🛡️ System Mission

The **Mule Account Detection Engine** is an AI-driven security framework engineered to identify post-onboarding mule account activity and rapid illicit fund laundering. By monitoring post-activation transaction velocity spikes, structural fan-in/fan-out flows, and device overlaps, the system detects suspicious accounts that pass standard KYC checks.

Designed as an enterprise compliance tool, it combines unsupervised anomaly scoring with automated, explainable regulatory reporting to minimize manual investigation overhead.
